<title>AUSTRALIA: BIGGEST GAINS/FALLS FOR ASX 100 INDEX IN LAST YEAR.</title>
<headline>BIGGEST GAINS/FALLS FOR ASX 100 INDEX IN LAST YEAR.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the year to August 8.</p>
