<p>Rank Name				    Price     pct change</p>
<p> 1   Oil Search		  4.15     207.41</p>
<p> 2   Macquarie Bank	   14.23     110.50</p>
<p> 3   Sthn Pac Pete	     3.60	92.51</p>
